│ Line 04  │ |                       open the Message in $PAGER     │          │
│ Line 05  │ q / Esc    h / ←        back to the list               │          │
│ Line 06  │                                                        │          │
│ Line 07  │ Message                                                │          │
│ Line 08  │ U                       mark the Message Unread        │          │
│ Line 09  │ Backspace               delete: move to Trash          │          │
│ Line 10  │ u                       undo the last delete           │          │
│ Line 11  │                                                        │          │
│ Line 12  │ Links                                                  │          │
│ Line 13  │ o                       label the links in the Preview │          │
│ Line 14  │                                                        │          │
│ Line 15  │ View                                                   │          │
